Subject: [PATCH] test(21-08): prove real dashboard capture fanout

---
 ...eus_supervision_capture_hub_browsertest.cc | 279 ++++++++++++++++++
 chrome/browser/ui/views/prometheus/BUILD.gn   |   1 +
 2 files changed, 280 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/prometheus/prometheus_supervision_capture_hub_browsertest.cc b/chrome/browser/prometheus/prometheus_supervision_capture_hub_browsertest.cc
